{"seq":1,"slug":"zone-asset-capacity-entity-model","title":"园区主体、载体与产能资源模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/zone-operations-data-platform/zone-asset-capacity-entity-model","wordCount":3002,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"园区主体-载体与产能资源模型\">园区主体、载体与产能资源模型</h1><p>一家跨境电商企业签下综保区内 5000 平方米的保税仓，招商系统里记下&quot;已出租&quot;，两个月后配电房却拒绝接入——那栋楼剩余变压器容量只有 800 千伏安，而客户的冷链分拣线需要 2000 千伏安。面积够了，电不够；合同成了，产能没成。根因不是招商不努力，而是<strong>资产台账把三个本该分开的东西塞进了一张表</strong>：谁在用（主体）、用的是哪个位置（载体）、那个位置能承载多少负荷（产能）。本文建立把三者拆开、再用显式关系绑回来的实体模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么必须把主体-载体-产能拆成三层\">核心概念：为什么必须把主体、载体、产能拆成三层</h2><p>园区数据最常见的坏味道，是一张名为 <code>units</code> 的宽表里同时出现 <code>tenant_name</code>、<code>building_id</code>、<code>area_sqm</code>、<code>power_kva</code> 四类字段。它能跑通招商看板，却在三个场景下必然崩塌：一个单元被两家企业分时共享（主体与载体多对多）、一栋楼整体转租后原租户仍承担用电主体（角色分裂）、同一条产线搬迁后原单元的容量配额需重新核发（产能与位置解耦）。</p>\n<p>三层的职责边界这样划：**主体（party）**回答&quot;法律上是谁&quot;，承担签约、申报、纳税、被监管的责任；**载体（asset）**回答&quot;物理上在哪里&quot;，是可测量、可围合、可报建的空间与构筑物；**产能资源（capacity resource）**回答&quot;那里能承载多少负荷&quot;，是电力、水、冷、网络、库位这类可量化、可占用、可回收的资源。三者共用一套标识符，各有独立生命周期。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>区域身份（综保区还是自贸试验区片区）决定载体上能开展什么业务，判定见 <a href=\"../zone-regime-investor-admission-model/sez-ftz-bonded-zone-regime-taxonomy\">经济特区、自贸区与保税区制度分类模型</a>；本文只管&quot;给定区域身份后，空间与产能如何被建模与分配&quot;。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"主体层-法律主体-角色与身份标识\">主体层：法律主体、角色与身份标识</h2><p>同一家公司在园区里往往同时扮演多个角色：宗地受让人、某栋楼业主、另一栋楼承租方、又是海关账册的经营单位。如果把&quot;企业&quot;和&quot;角色&quot;压成一个字段，系统就无法回答&quot;这栋楼的用电责任主体是谁&quot;——业主和实际用电人常常不是同一法人。正确做法是<strong>主体与角色分离</strong>：<code>party</code> 表存法人身份，<code>party_role</code> 表用多对多关系把主体挂到具体角色与具体载体上，并记录角色的<strong>生效时间窗</strong>。角色集合至少包括受让人（land_grantee）、业主（owner）、运营方（operator）、承租方（tenant）、申报单位（declarant）、用电户（utility_account_holder）。主体的唯一标识需跨系统可核验：境内主体以<strong>统一社会信用代码</strong>为主键（国家标准 GB 32100-2015，18 位，含机构类别、组织机构代码与校验位）；涉及跨境投资或受益所有人穿透时补挂<strong>法人机构识别编码 LEI</strong>（Legal Entity Identifier，ISO 17442，20 位定长、含校验位、由本地运行单位 LOU 签发）。另一易忽略点是<strong>主体状态不是布尔值</strong>——企业可能&quot;存续&quot;&quot;迁出&quot;&quot;注销&quot;&quot;列入经营异常名录&quot;，状态变化影响其名下所有载体的合规判定，因此需要 <code>status</code> 加状态变更事件流，而非一个 <code>is_active</code> 标志。</p>\n<h2 id=\"载体层-从宗地到工位的四级空间分解\">载体层：从宗地到工位的四级空间分解</h2><p>载体建模的关键不是&quot;建多少层&quot;，而是<strong>每一层的切分粒度都要对应一种真实的登记或计价行为</strong>：切得太粗，产能与合同挂不上去；切得太细，维护成本超过收益。四级分解（宗地 → 楼栋 → 楼层 → 单元）覆盖绝大多数登记、报建、租赁与容量核发行为，工位/库位作为可选第五级挂在单元之下。四级分别对应：**宗地（parcel）**对应不动产权证与用地规划许可，是容积率、投资强度、亩均效益的核算基准；**楼栋（building）**对应建设工程规划许可与消防验收；**楼层（floor）**对应层高、楼面荷载、货梯可达性；**单元（unit）**对应租赁合同与海关账册的物理落点。</p>\n<p>面积口径是这一层最容易出错的地方——同一个&quot;10000 平方米&quot;，可能是用地面积、总建筑面积或可租赁面积，三者相差可达数倍。工业用地强度指标以<strong>用地面积</strong>为分母（容积率、投资强度、亩均税收皆如此），租赁计价则以<strong>可租赁面积</strong>为口径，后者国际通行做法委托 BOMA 测量标准统一，国内计算依据 GB/T 50353-2013。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>定义要点</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用地面积</td>\n<td>宗地红线内水平投影面积</td>\n<td>容积率、投资强度、亩均效益分母</td>\n<td>不动产权证 / 土地出让合同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总建筑面积</td>\n<td>各层建筑面积之和</td>\n<td>报建、竣工验收、房产登记</td>\n<td>GB/T 50353-2013</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计容建筑面积</td>\n<td>计入容积率的部分（扣除地下、架空等）</td>\n<td>容积率合规校核</td>\n<td>地方规划技术规定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>套内建筑面积</td>\n<td>单元内墙体围合面积</td>\n<td>结构、消防分区</td>\n<td>房产测绘成果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可租赁面积</td>\n<td>套内 + 分摊公摊</td>\n<td>租金计价、出租率</td>\n<td>BOMA 测量标准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>容积率是载体层唯一必须精确到公式的指标。设某宗地计容建筑面积为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、用地面积为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FAR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FAR} = \\frac{A_c}{A_p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FAR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>容积率是<strong>批复上限</strong>，实测超出即触发规划违法，因此载体表必须同时存 <code>far_approved</code>（批复值）与 <code>far_actual</code>（测绘核算值），二者之差是运营平台最该盯的合规信号之一。亩均指标同理：设某主体年税收为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、占用用地面积为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（单位亩），则亩均税收为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T / A_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它把&quot;载体占用&quot;直接换算成监管口径的绩效数字。载体层还需注意<strong>工业上楼的特殊约束</strong>：厂房向高层发展时&quot;楼层&quot;不再同质，首层可重型设备、标准层可一般生产线、高层往往只能轻型组装或仓储；层高、楼面活荷载、货梯载重与尺寸等字段必须落在楼层实体上，否则招商匹配会在物理层面失效。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[宗地 parcel&lt;br/&gt;不动产权证] --&gt; B1[楼栋 building&lt;br/&gt;规划许可/消防验收]&#10;  P --&gt; B2[楼栋 building]&#10;  B1 --&gt; F1[楼层 floor&lt;br/&gt;层高/荷载/货梯]&#10;  B1 --&gt; F2[楼层 floor]&#10;  F1 --&gt; U1[单元 unit&lt;br/&gt;租赁/账册落点]&#10;  F1 --&gt; U2[单元 unit]&#10;  U1 --&gt; L1[库位/工位 location&lt;br/&gt;可选第五级]&#10;  U1 --&gt; L2[库位/工位 location]&#10;  R[产能资源 capacity] --&gt;|绑定| B1&#10;  R --&gt;|绑定| F1&#10;  R --&gt;|绑定| U1&#10;  PT[主体 party] -.-&gt;|party_role 多对多| U1&#10;  PT -.-&gt;|party_role| B1\">graph TD\n  P[宗地 parcel&lt;br/&gt;不动产权证] --&gt; B1[楼栋 building&lt;br/&gt;规划许可/消防验收]\n  P --&gt; B2[楼栋 building]\n  B1 --&gt; F1[楼层 floor&lt;br/&gt;层高/荷载/货梯]\n  B1 --&gt; F2[楼层 floor]\n  F1 --&gt; U1[单元 unit&lt;br/&gt;租赁/账册落点]\n  F1 --&gt; U2[单元 unit]\n  U1 --&gt; L1[库位/工位 location&lt;br/&gt;可选第五级]\n  U1 --&gt; L2[库位/工位 location]\n  R[产能资源 capacity] --&gt;|绑定| B1\n  R --&gt;|绑定| F1\n  R --&gt;|绑定| U1\n  PT[主体 party] -.-&gt;|party_role 多对多| U1\n  PT -.-&gt;|party_role| B1</pre><h2 id=\"产能资源层-把物理约束变成可分配配额\">产能资源层：把物理约束变成可分配配额</h2><p>载体回答&quot;有多大地方&quot;，产能回答&quot;能承载多少负荷&quot;，二者必须解耦——同一栋楼的电力容量可在多个楼层、单元之间灵活切分，而楼栋本身不会因此变多。产能资源的核心特征是<strong>可量化、可占用、可回收、可跨载体共享</strong>。园区需要建模的产能资源至少有六类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源类型</th>\n<th>计量单位</th>\n<th>典型约束</th>\n<th>关键属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电力容量</td>\n<td>千伏安 kVA</td>\n<td>变压器容量、双回路冗余</td>\n<td>已分配 / 剩余 / 峰值负荷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>给排水</td>\n<td>吨/日</td>\n<td>市政接入管径</td>\n<td>供水量 / 排水量 / 消防水池</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蒸汽/冷量</td>\n<td>吨/时、冷吨 RT</td>\n<td>锅炉或冷冻机组容量</td>\n<td>供汽压力 / 供回水温</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络带宽</td>\n<td>Gbps</td>\n<td>接入点与上联带宽</td>\n<td>专线 / 双上联 / 时延等级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库位与货架</td>\n<td>个、吨</td>\n<td>温区、货架承重</td>\n<td>常温/冷藏/冷冻温区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>充电与储能</td>\n<td>千瓦 kW</td>\n<td>配电容量、峰谷电价</td>\n<td>装机功率 / 利用小时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>电力最具代表性。设某楼栋变压器总容量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>（kVA）、已核发配额之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，容量预留系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>，则剩余可分配容量为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>free</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{free}} = C \\cdot (1 - \\eta) - \\sum_i c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">free</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>（通常取 10%–20%，用于应对同时率偏差与消防负荷）不是可随意压缩的&quot;余量&quot;，而是工程安全下限。系统若不允许配置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>，就会在招商压力下把容量分配到 100%，最终导致实际接入失败——这正是本文开头那起事故的数字版本。产能建制另一条硬规则是：<strong>容量是&quot;核发&quot;而非&quot;售出&quot;</strong>，配额以带生效期与失效期的记录存在，绑定 <code>party_role</code> 与 <code>unit</code>，租约终止时回收进可分配池而非删除，历史峰值与监管核查才有据可查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关系层-把三层绑成一张可查询的图\">关系层：把三层绑成一张可查询的图</h2><p>三层实体各自独立，价值却全在关系上。至少需要五类关系：主体—角色（多对多）、角色—载体（租赁/权属，带时间窗）、载体—载体（包含）、载体—产能（容量绑定）、产能—主体（配额核发）。把这些关系放进带时间维度的关系表，是园区数据平台区别于静态资产台账的分水岭。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  PT[party 主体] --&gt;|1:N| PR[party_role 角色]&#10;  PR --&gt;|N:1 带时间窗| U[unit 单元]&#10;  U --&gt;|N:1| F[floor 楼层]&#10;  F --&gt;|N:1| B[building 楼栋]&#10;  B --&gt;|N:1| P[parcel 宗地]&#10;  PR --&gt;|1:N 配额核发| CR[capacity_quota 配额]&#10;  CR --&gt;|N:1| C[capacity_resource 产能]&#10;  C --&gt;|N:1 归属| B&#10;  LEASE[lease 租赁合同] --&gt;|N:1| PR&#10;  LEASE --&gt;|N:1| U\">graph LR\n  PT[party 主体] --&gt;|1:N| PR[party_role 角色]\n  PR --&gt;|N:1 带时间窗| U[unit 单元]\n  U --&gt;|N:1| F[floor 楼层]\n  F --&gt;|N:1| B[building 楼栋]\n  B --&gt;|N:1| P[parcel 宗地]\n  PR --&gt;|1:N 配额核发| CR[capacity_quota 配额]\n  CR --&gt;|N:1| C[capacity_resource 产能]\n  C --&gt;|N:1 归属| B\n  LEASE[lease 租赁合同] --&gt;|N:1| PR\n  LEASE --&gt;|N:1| U</pre><p>这张图回答了几个此前无法回答的问题：某单元<strong>当前</strong>的用电责任主体是谁——沿 <code>unit → lease → party_role → party</code> 按生效时间过滤；某栋楼还剩多少可分配容量——楼栋容量减去名下所有未失效配额；某主体在某区域占用多少用地——其所有 <code>parcel</code> 角色的用地面积求和。共同前提是<strong>每条关系都带生效期与失效期</strong>，而非 <code>is_current</code> 布尔值，否则&quot;谁在什么时间用了什么&quot;将无法回溯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标识符-时态与数据治理\">标识符、时态与数据治理</h2><p>实体模型能否落地，取决于标识符是否稳定、时态是否可追溯。载体标识符应遵循<strong>层级编码</strong>且不可复用：五段式 <code>ZONE-PARCEL-BLDG-FLOOR-UNIT</code>，一旦某单元被物理拆分或合并，旧编码作废、新编码生成，绝不把旧编码指向新的物理空间——否则历史合同、海关账册与产能配额会全部错位。</p>\n<p>时态治理有两条路线：**双时态（bitemporal）**同时记录&quot;业务生效时间&quot;与&quot;系统记录时间&quot;，适合监管审计；<strong>单时态 + 事件流</strong>只记业务生效时间，变更通过事件追加，实现更轻。涉及海关账册与税收核查时，建议至少对载体与产能配额采用双时态，因为监管问询常问&quot;当时的台账长什么样&quot;。载体与产能模型还需对接监管回传口径：地方&quot;亩产效益&quot;评价按宗地或主体上报亩均税收、亩均增加值，分母正是载体层用地面积；海关账册要求在区货物能反向定位到具体 <code>unit</code>。当载体编码稳定、关系带时态时，这些回传是查询而非人工报表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>园区资产台账必须把<strong>主体、载体、产能</strong>拆成三层：主体答&quot;法律上是谁&quot;，载体答&quot;物理上在哪里&quot;，产能答&quot;能承载多少负荷&quot;。三者共用标识符，各有独立生命周期。</li>\n<li>主体层做<strong>主体与角色分离</strong>，用多对多关系 + 生效时间窗承载&quot;同一法人多重角色&quot;；主键用统一社会信用代码（GB 32100-2015），跨境穿透补挂 LEI（ISO 17442）。</li>\n<li>载体层用<strong>宗地 → 楼栋 → 楼层 → 单元</strong>四级分解，每级对应真实登记行为；面积口径区分用地/总计容/可租赁，容积率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FAR</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FAR} = A_c / A_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FAR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 同时存批复值与实测值。</li>\n<li>产能层把物理约束变成<strong>可核发、可回收的配额</strong>，电力分配必须保留容量预留系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>free</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{free}} = C(1-\\eta) - \\sum_i c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">free</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是不可压缩的工程下限。</li>\n<li>三层靠<strong>带时态的关系层</strong>绑成可查询的图，双时态是应对海关与亩产效益监管问询的安全选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本文定义了园区运营平台的空间与资源骨架。产能如何随租约与订单动态调度、仓储库位如何与库存系统对账，属于相邻的运营主题域，需在掌握实体模型后再进入。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"园区主体、载体与产能资源模型","id":"园区主体-载体与产能资源模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么必须把主体、载体、产能拆成三层","id":"核心概念-为什么必须把主体-载体-产能拆成三层"},{"level":2,"text":"主体层：法律主体、角色与身份标识","id":"主体层-法律主体-角色与身份标识"},{"level":2,"text":"载体层：从宗地到工位的四级空间分解","id":"载体层-从宗地到工位的四级空间分解"},{"level":2,"text":"产能资源层：把物理约束变成可分配配额","id":"产能资源层-把物理约束变成可分配配额"},{"level":2,"text":"关系层：把三层绑成一张可查询的图","id":"关系层-把三层绑成一张可查询的图"},{"level":2,"text":"标识符、时态与数据治理","id":"标识符-时态与数据治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"优惠追缴、骗补识别与争议处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/incentive-compliance-risk-control/clawback-fraud-detection-dispute"},"next":{"title":"园区数据交换与单一窗口/海关系统集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/zone-operations-data-platform/zone-data-exchange-single-window-integration"}}